 there are Faust contributors everywhere across the globe, Faust is mainly being developed at Grame, Centre National de Creation Musicale (), its birthplace."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","fingerprint":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:32.807Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:03.762Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Faust (Functional Audio Stream) is a functional programming language specifically designed for real-time signal processing and synthesis. A distinctive characteristic of Faust is that it is fully compiled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Faust (Functional Audio Stream) is a functional programming language specifically designed for real-time signal processing and synthesis. A distinctive characteristic of Faust is that it is fully compiled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:03.763Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T20:09:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/blob/master-dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:03.763Z","hash":"b3a3dd2f6191a45b3fce3671f2ed9c4db8b6f81714b8d3184095bc6c07ae9103","originalBytes":12122,"storedBytes":12122,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:03.696Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:17.702Z","latestRelease":{"name":"Faust version 2.88.0","tag":"2.88.0","publishedAt":"2026-09-09T19:28:52Z","url":"https://github.com/grame-cncm/faust/releases/tag/2.88.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:17.702Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/b05d7c863037b25f6156f8ac.jpg","kind":"demo